# Scratch files written by the verification tools while they run.
# TOOLS/probe_platform.py, audit_mobile.py and audit_a11y.py copy each page with a probe
# script appended, serve the copy, and delete it afterwards. A commit made while one of
# them is running will otherwise sweep the copies in - which happened once, adding ten
# files that are not part of the site.
_probe_*
_m_*
_f_*
_a_*
_dbg.html
